design='''# Withdrawal Record: definitions, types and logic design

Select the exact current C66 positive Definition cal.definition.withdrawal-record@1.0.0-candidate.1; admission of the Definition creates no real withdrawal. Native translation starts only after Semantic Epoch full seal and separate actual audit. Source-only inspection creates neither interpretation nor finite model.

Keep Record,Identifier,SubjectReference,ContentDigestReference,WithdrawalPosture,Reason,EffectiveTime,OwnerDecision,Evidence,ChallengeRoute,SuccessorAuthority,HistoricalResolution and RecoveryRule as proposed separate sorts. They are not new canonical Definition identities. A record permanently preserves one retired or rejected identifier and exact subject binding. Digest obligations are conditional on digest availability; a missing digest needs explicit correspondence rather than invented hash contents. Reason,time,posture,owner Decision,evidence and challenge route are necessary declared components.

Distinguish effective withdrawal from deprecation,rejection,suspension,deletion,archival and ordinary closure. Identifier reuse is rejected while the record is effective. The source's explicit higher-order recovery exception requires a separate selected rule; no ordinary restoration or reuse authority follows from the record. Historical lookup must expose the disposition without loading a deleted subject; real storage,lookup,retention and availability remain independent targets.

An optional successor names independently resolving lineage/replacement authority and retains its own identity/admission state. No successor is universally required; references do not merge identities,automatically supersede a subject or authenticate actual authority. Claimed successor fields need conditional exact bindings and independent resolution/admission evidence. The formal governed/bounded implication and authority-effect noninference must remain explicit alongside richer normative guards.

Account every normative,formal,boundary and testable unit,with notation/intuitive examples explanatory and metadata scope/claim ceilings explicit. Supply selected/outside records,effective/inactive cases,optional digest/successor alternatives,explicit recovery-rule cases and independent authority witnesses. Reject missing fields,identity reuse,untyped successor merging and effect inference in declaration controls. Query actual withdrawal,identity reservation,authentic owner decisions,hash/subject fidelity,historical availability,independent successor admission and authority without assuming them in T.

Source precedence,real time/availability,permanence/recovery semantics,identifier/subject universes,withdrawal posture,owner/evidence maps and consumer correspondence stay pending. Preserve source bytes,prior seals,original183/189/201scope and121/511/797/36planningdenominators. No identifier is withdrawn,restored,reused,deleted or superseded by this preparation.
'''
with (dest/'TYPES-LOGIC-DESIGN.md').open('x') as f:f.write(design)
